---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import { heroSrcset } from '../../utils/images';
---

<Layout
  title="Breakfast | Toile Blanche | Saint-Paul de Vence"
  description="Start the day with local pastries, fresh fruit, and good coffee at Toile Blanche."
  ogImage="https://www.toileblanche.com/assets/images/breakfast/StP25-ToileBlanche-c-GaelleSimon-27.jpg"
>
  <Nav theme="light" />

  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="info-header">
      <div class="info-header-inner">
        <p class="info-eyebrow">The Morning</p>
        <h1>Breakfast</h1>
        <p class="info-tagline">Coffee, croissants, and the sound of the garden waking up. One of the things guests remember most.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bkf-image">
      <img src="/assets/images/breakfast/StP25-ToileBlanche-c-GaelleSimon-27.jpg" srcset={heroSrcset('/assets/images/breakfast/StP25-ToileBlanche-c-GaelleSimon-27.jpg')} sizes="100vw" width="4898" height="3265" alt="Breakfast spread at Toile Blanche" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
    </section>

    <section class="info-body">
      <div class="info-body-inner">
        <h2>No need to rush</h2>
        <p>Whether you are an early riser wanting to start the day as soon as possible, or a late sleeper, you can take breakfast at your own pace. We serve from the kitchen or to your suite.</p>

        <h2>What to expect</h2>
        <p>Fresh bread and pastries from a local bakery. Seasonal fruit. Eggs prepared as you like them. Good coffee, and plenty of it. Local honey, jams, and cheeses. Orange juice pressed that morning.</p>

        <h2>Hours</h2>
        <p>Breakfast is served every day from <strong>8:00 AM to 10:30 AM</strong>.</p>
        <p>If you need an earlier start, please let reception know the evening before and we will arrange something.</p>

        <h2>Where</h2>
        <p>In the breakfast room, on the terrace overlooking the gardens, or delivered to your suite — your choice.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style is:global>
  @import '/css/info-page.css';

  .bkf-image {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16/9;
    max-height: 400px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .bkf-image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 40%;
    display: block;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .bkf-image {
      max-height: 280px;
    }
  }
</style>
